@startuml dataflow_rag_chatbot
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam SequenceArrowThickness 1.5

title Data Flow: RAG Chatbot Pipeline\n(Context Token -> Hybrid Retrieval -> Graph-aware Reranking -> SSE)

actor "Learner" as Learner
participant "web-bff\n(Next.js)" as Web
participant "core-api" as Core
participant "chat-service" as Chat
participant "BGE-M3\nEmbedder" as Embedder
database "Qdrant\nlearning_chunks" as Qdrant
database "Neo4j\nKnowledge Graph" as Neo4j
participant "RRF + Graph-aware\nReranker" as Reranker
participant "LLM\nGemini" as LLM
database "PostgreSQL\nchat_messages" as PG

== 1. Context authorization ==
Learner -> Web : send question
Web -> Core : POST /chat/context-token\n(LTI session)
Core -> Core : validate LTI session\nrole + course access
Core --> Web : short-lived JWT\n{user_id, course_id,\nallowed_lo_ids, exp=60s}

== 2. SSE handshake ==
Web -> Chat : GET /chat/stream\nJWT ticket + question
Chat -> Chat : validate JWT\nscope + signature + expiry

== 3. Query embedding ==
Chat -> Embedder : embed dense + sparse(question)
Embedder --> Chat : dense_vector[1024]\n+ sparse lexical weights

== 4. Hybrid retrieval on Qdrant ==
Chat -> Qdrant : dense search\nfilter={course_id, allowed_lo_ids}, top_k=N
Qdrant --> Chat : dense_results[]
Chat -> Qdrant : sparse search\nfilter={course_id, allowed_lo_ids}, top_k=N
Qdrant --> Chat : sparse_results[]

== 5. RRF fusion ==
Chat -> Reranker : reciprocal_rank_fusion\n(dense_results, sparse_results)
Reranker --> Chat : fused_candidates[]

== 6. Graph-aware reranking ==
Chat -> Neo4j : MATCH LO / Chapter / Concept\nfor course_id + candidate chunks
Neo4j --> Chat : graph_context\n{lo, chapter, concept, paths}
Chat -> Reranker : boost_by_graph_context\n(candidates, graph_context)
Reranker --> Chat : final_context[]

== 7. LLM streaming generation ==
Chat -> LLM : generate_stream\n(system guardrail,\nquestion, final_context)
LLM --> Chat : token stream + citations
Chat --> Web : SSE token stream\nanswer + citations
Web --> Learner : realtime answer\nwith source references

== 8. Audit and learning history ==
Chat -> PG : INSERT chat_messages\n{question, answer,\nchunks_used, latency_ms, course_id}

@enduml
